Author: dowiyogo <dowiyogo@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Jun 21 09:15:26 2026 +0200

    fix(optics): port exec22 TIR fix to EndTop build (CreateBarSkinReflector)
    
    exec22-endtop-optfix: ports the optical surface fix from ej200_endonly exec21-optfix
    to the EndTop reference build.
    
    Change in src/Materials.cc:293-333 (CreateBarSkinReflector):
      - dielectric_metal (no TIR) → dielectric_dielectric (TIR enabled)
      - polished finish, sigma_alpha=0 (specular Fresnel)
      - REFLECTIVITY=0.95 in MPT for non-TIR photon recovery (Mylar model)
    
    Root cause context (EXEC_21): the old dielectric_metal surface caused ~300x
    photon deficit at END SiPMs (0.37 vs ~40 PE real). Even metallic R=1.0 gives
    only ~1.2 PE because ABSLENGTH kills photons over 164-bounce average path.
    
    Velocity audit (T2): zero superluminal photons before/after fix (verified in endonly build).
    
    DO NOT re-run the EndTop 5000-ev/pos campaign without explicit René approval.
    Pending re-simulation command documented in EXEC_22_REPORT.md.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

